Suggest paper from published questions</button><p class="muted">AI only selects reviewed, published questions. Check the draft before saving; no student data is sent.</p></div></div><div class="exam-question-picker"><div class="section-heading"><div><h3>Published questions</h3><p class="muted">Questions must match the selected class and subject.</p></div><span id="exam-question-total" class="count-pill">0 marks</span></div><div id="available-questions" class="available-questions"><p class="muted">Choose a class and subject to load questions.</p></div><div class="section-heading"><h3>Paper questions</h3><span id="selected-question-count" class="count-pill">0 questions</span></div><div id="selected-questions" class="selected-questions"><p class="muted">No questions selected.</p></div></div><div class="planning-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save exam draft</button><button class="button" type="button" id="exam-reset">New exam</button></div></form></section><section class="content-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">APPROVAL AND RESULTS</div><h2>Exam workflow</h2></div><button class="button" type="button" id="exam-refresh">Refresh</button></div><div id="exam-list" class="exam-list"><p class="muted">Loading examinations…</p></div></section></div></main></div><dialog id="exam-review-dialog" class="subject-dialog"><form method="dialog"><div class="subject-dialog-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">ACADEMIC REVIEW</div><h2>Review examination</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-button" data-close-exam-review aria-label="Close">×</button></div><div class="subject-dialog-body"><input type="hidden" id="review-exam-id"><label for="exam-review-feedback">Feedback <span class="muted">(required when returning)</span></label><textarea id="exam-review-feedback" rows="4" maxlength="4000"></textarea><div class="planning-actions"><button type="button" class="button primary" data-exam-decision="approved">Approve</button><button type="button" class="button danger" data-exam-decision="returned">Return with feedback</button></div></div></form></dialog></body></html>
